      "created_at": "2015-04-16T22:03:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>On this page: http://sentinelsdigital.com/variants.html<br><br>You can read the following phrase: \"30 days after first release, each Variant will also have a password posted here that will automatically unlock that Variant in-game. However, using this password to unlock a Variant will not fulfill any related achievement once those are added to the game.\"<br><br>Are characters that we've unlocked legitimately already being tracked? I really don't want to have to do Cosmic Omnitron's or Dark Watch Mr. Fixer's unlock conditions again.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:32.105Z",
